; South Cape through departure for Edward Castle. Speaker templates and pauses
; follow Gaia and Time. [AD] is the single-tile ellipsis. The active text-speed option controls ordinary dialogue.

?INCLUDE 'sc01_astronomer'
sc01_astronomer.dialogstring_0488FB! `[BOR:3][PRT:@CapeLower4][PRT:@CapeResident]An astronomer I know told[N]me something strange.[WAI][N]There's a star in the sky[N]that's been growing[N]brighter night after[N]night.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'sc01_fisherman'
sc01_fisherman.dialogstring_04840F! `[BOR:3][PRT:@CapeLower4][PRT:@CapeResident]Even in a different spot,[N]I still can't catch[N]anything at all[AD][END]`
sc01_fisherman.dialogstring_0483F6! `[BOR:3][PRT:@CapeLower4][PRT:@CapeResident]Tch. Not catching[N]anything at all[AD][END]`
sc01_fisherman.dialogstring_048436! `[BOR:3][PRT:@CapeLower4][PRT:@CapeResident]I accidentally fished up[N]this weird pot.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'sc01_girl1'
sc01_girl1.dialogstring_0480FF! `[BOR:3][DLG:5,8][SIZ:8,1][PRT:@CapeResident][DLY:2]10[AD] 9[AD] 8[AD] 7[AD] 6[AD][END]`
sc01_girl1.dialogstring_048112! `[BOR:3][DLG:7,8][SIZ:8,1][PRT:@CapeResident][DLY:2]5[AD] 4[AD] 3[AD] 2[AD] 1![END]`
sc01_girl1.dialogstring_048125! `[BOR:3][DLG:4,8][SIZ:B,1][PRT:@CapeResident]Tsk, it's always me[AD][END]`

?INCLUDE 'sc01_girl2'
sc01_girl2.dialogstring_04816B! `[BOR:3][PRT:@CapeLower4][PRT:@CapeResident]It's mysterious. Why's[N]this one called "The[N]Statue Game[AD]?"[END]`

?INCLUDE 'sc01_girl3'
sc01_girl3.dialogstring_0481D6! `[BOR:3][PRT:@CapeLower4][PRT:@CapeResident]How long have we been[N]playing this game?[END]`

?INCLUDE 'sc01_guard'
sc01_guard.dialogstring_0485B6! `[CLD][BOR:3][PRT:@CapeLower4][PRT:@CapeResident]Hey, hey! Monsters have[N]been prowling outside of[N]town recently, you know.[N]Has nobody warned you?[WAI][N]You shouldn't go wandering[N]outside town alone.[END]`
sc01_guard.dialogstring_048612! `[BOR:3][PRT:@CapeLower4][PRT:@CapeResident]King Edward has summoned[N]you to the castle? Well,[N]just be careful.[END]`
sc01_guard.dialogstring_048647! `[BOR:3][PRT:@CapeLower4][PRT:@CapeResident]Be careful, huh?[END]`

?INCLUDE 'sc01_house_intro'
sc01_house_intro.dialogstring_04BD5F! `[PRT:@CapeLower4]This is Lance's house.[N]He lives here with his[N]frail mother, just the two[N]of them.[END]`
sc01_house_intro.dialogstring_04BD1B! `[PRT:@CapeLower4]This is Will's house.[N]A nice smell wafts by.[N]His grandma Lola must be[N]baking one of her pies.[END]`
sc01_house_intro.dialogstring_04BD9B! `[PRT:@CapeLower3]This is Erik's house.[N]It's the biggest house in[N]South Cape.[FIN]Will can't help feeling a[N]little jealous that Erik[N]was born into money[AD][END]`
sc01_house_intro.dialogstring_04BE05! `[DEF]Will leaves the cave as[N]dusk paints the sky.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'sc01_jar_door'
sc01_jar_door.dialogstring_048A48! `[CLD][BOR:3][PRT:@CapeUpper1][PRT:@CapeWill]Will: Whoa! Watch it![END]`

?INCLUDE 'sc01_roof_man'
sc01_roof_man.dialogstring_0484B7! `[CLD][BOR:3][PRT:@CapeLower4][PRT:@CapeResident]Come on, Will. How many[N]times do I have to tell[N]you not to come up here?[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][PRT:@CapeLower4][PRT:@CapeResident][AD]Well, since you're here,[N]could you do me a favor?[WAI][N]The bell sounds strange[N]lately. I think something[N]may be stuck inside it.[WAI][N]Would you take a look?[WAI][N]And please don't go[N]jumping off anything up[N]here.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'sc01_salesman'
sc01_salesman.dialogstring_0482D7! `[BOR:3][PRT:@CapeLower4][PRT:@CapeResident]Salesman: I go around to[N]everyone's houses selling[N]weapons, so they can fight[N]those monsters.[WAI][N]It's a dangerous world out[N]there these days. Still, I[N]can't justify selling a[N]weapon to a kid like you.[END]`
sc01_salesman.dialogstring_04835C! `[BOR:3][PRT:@CapeLower4][PRT:@CapeResident]Salesman: Hmmm[AD][END]`

?INCLUDE 'sc01_sprint_man'
sc01_sprint_man.dialogstring_04923D! `[CLD][BOR:3][PRT:@CapeLower4][PRT:@CapeResident]You seem like you've got[N]pretty fast feet, huh?[N]Have you tried sprinting?[WAI][N]Double time![N]Hold Run![WAI][N]Or just keep going[AD][N][PAU:12]that works too.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'sc01_startled_woman'
sc01_startled_woman.dialogstring_0487BF! `[BOR:2][DLG:10,8][SIZ:3,1][PRT:@CapeResident]Eek![FIN][CLD][BOR:3][PRT:@CapeLower4][PRT:@CapeResident]What are you doing?[N]Good grief, child[AD][END]`
sc01_startled_woman.dialogstring_0487F5! `[BOR:3][PRT:@CapeLower4][PRT:@CapeResident]I envy the way the sea[N]breeze blows your hair[N]around. Not like mine,[N]under this scarf[AD][END]`
sc01_startled_woman.dialogstring_0487F1! `[BOR:3][PRT:@CapeLower2][PRT:@CapeResident]What are you doing? This[N]kid! Good grief[AD][END]`

?INCLUDE 'sc01_sympathetic_woman'
sc01_sympathetic_woman.dialogstring_04899E! `[CLD][BOR:3][PRT:@CapeLower4][PRT:@CapeResident]I can't help but pity[N]poor Seth.[WAI][N]It's hard on someone[N]so young to see his[N]parents fighting day in[N]and day out, you know?[END]`

?INCLUDE 'sc01_worried_woman'
sc01_worried_woman.dialogstring_04871E! `[BOR:3][PRT:@CapeLower4][PRT:@CapeResident]I'm getting worried about[N]all of these strange[N]merchants we've been[N]seeing around here lately.[WAI][N]I think they're taking[N]advantage of people's[N]concern over the recent[N]appearance of monsters.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'sc02_card'
sc02_card.dialogstring_04B00F! `[DEF]Will picks up a card.[WAI][N]It is the Ace of[N]Diamonds, of course![END]`

?INCLUDE 'sc02_entry'
sc02_entry.dialogstring_04BE87! `[DEF]The four friends called[N]this seaside cave their[N]second home.[FIN]Usually, they met here[N]after their lessons at[N]church were finished and[N]chatted until the sun set.[END]`
sc02_entry.dialogstring_04BF35! `[BOR:3][PRT:@CapeUpper4][PRT:@CapeLance]Lance: What the heck,[N]Will? Going home already?[WAI][N]Dinner time's still a ways[N]off, so let's stick around[N]and have fun a bit longer.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'sc02_erik'
sc02_erik.dialogstring_04B9AF! `[DEF][DLY:0]Suddenly, Erik came[N]rushing in, looking[N]urgent![WAI][CLD]`
sc02_erik.dialogstring_04BA55! `[BOR:3][PRT:@CapeUpper4][PRT:@CapeLance]Lance: Come on, so what?[N]With ya barging in here[N]like that, I thought[N]something cooler happened.[WAI][N]Besides, that "princess"[N]is just that selfish girl[N]Kara, yeah? Who cares[N]about someone like that?[END]`
sc02_erik.dialogstring_04B9F2! `[BOR:2][PRT:@CapeUpper4][PRT:@CapeErik]Erik: *huff huff*[N]News! It's BIG news![WAI][N]Edward Castle's princess[N]has gone missing! They say[N]she came to this town![END]`
sc02_erik.dialogstring_04BB59! `[BOR:3][PRT:@CapeUpper4][PRT:@CapeErik]Erik: Dang, I thought[N]everyone was gonna be so[N]amazed[AD][END]`
sc02_erik.dialogstring_04BB89! `[BOR:3][PRT:@CapeUpper4][PRT:@CapeErik]Erik: You moved the statue[N]without going near it the[N]other day, right?[END]`
sc02_erik.dialogstring_04BBB6! `[BOR:3][PRT:@CapeUpper4][PRT:@CapeErik]Erik: If only I could do[N]that too[AD][END]`
sc02_erik.dialogstring_04BC16! `[BOR:3][PRT:@CapeUpper4][PRT:@CapeErik]Erik: Phew. I'm[N]speechless[AD][FIN][CLD][BOR:3][PRT:@CapeUpper4][PRT:@CapeErik]Hey, Seth.[WAI][N]This sort of thing is[N]called extrasensory[N]perception, right?[END]`

?INCLUDE 'sc02_lance'
sc02_lance.dialogstring_04B1CB! `[BOR:3][PRT:@CapeUpper4][PRT:@CapeLance]Lance: What gives, Will?[N]You're pretty late, man.[WAI][N]I'm in the middle of a[N]game of War with Seth.[N]Wait a sec.[END]`
sc02_lance.dialogstring_04B23F! `[BOR:3][PRT:@CapeUpper4][PRT:@CapeLance]Lance: That toy I lost[AD][N]Ya dreamt I'd find it in[N]the closet.[WAI][N]That's exactly where it[N]was.[END]`
sc02_lance.dialogstring_04B27E! `[BOR:3][PRT:@CapeUpper4][PRT:@CapeLance]Lance: Alright. This time,[N]let's try the card trick.[WAI][N]I'll put four cards face[N]down. Pick the one ya[N]think is the Ace of[N]Diamonds.[END]`
sc02_lance.dialogstring_04B2F0! `[BOR:3][PRT:@CapeUpper4][PRT:@CapeLance]Lance: Go on. Choose the[N]one ya think is the Ace[N]of Diamonds.[END]`
sc02_lance.dialogstring_04B344! `[PAU:1E][CLD][BOR:3][PRT:@CapeUpper4][PRT:@CapeLance]Lance: Even if you've[N]changed, we're still[N]friends.[END]`
sc02_lance.dialogstring_04B210! `[BOR:3][PRT:@CapeUpper4][PRT:@CapeLance]Lance: Don't just stand[N]there, Will. Go sit next[N]to Erik.[END]`
sc02_lance.dialogstring_04B328! `[PAU:1E][BOR:3][PRT:@CapeUpper2][PRT:@CapeLance]Lance: Ahh. Right on the[N]money![END]`
sc02_lance.dialogstring_04B386! `[BOR:3][PRT:@CapeUpper4][PRT:@CapeLance]Lance: Come on, Seth.[N]While the cards are out,[N]let's play another game.[END]`
sc02_lance.dialogstring_04B3AD! `[BOR:3][PRT:@CapeUpper4][PRT:@CapeLance]Lance: One more game with[N]Seth and I'm going home.[END]`
sc02_lance.dialogstring_04B3DF! `[BOR:3][PRT:@CapeUpper4][PRT:@CapeLance]Lance: We get a break from[N]church lessons today. I[N]wonder if there's anything[N]interesting going on.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'sc02_seth'

; Lance sets $0B after his last post-card line and clears the cave exit lock.
; Seth falls through to this seated state then, or enters it on a later visit.
; His pre-game handler falls through to code_04B592, so leave that label alone.
sc02_seth.code_04B551! {
    COP [SetInteractHandler] ( &CapeSethAfterCards )
    COP [SetEntryHere]
    COP [StageSpriteFrame] ( #33 )
    COP [AnimOnce]
    RTL
}

CapeSethAfterCards {
    COP [BranchIfHasItem] ( #1C, &code_04B592 )
    JMP $&CapeSethGiveGlasses
}

sc02_seth.code_04B59C! {
    COP [BranchIfHasItem] ( #1C, &cape_seth_later_talk )
    JMP $&CapeSethGiveGlasses
  cape_seth_later_talk:
    COP [BranchOnFlagByte] ( #25, #01, &code_04B5A7 )
    COP [PrintDialogString] ( &dialogstring_04B5B6 )
    RTL
}

CapeSethGiveGlasses {
    COP [PrintDialogString] ( &CapeSethGlassesOffer )
    COP [GiveItem] ( #1C, &cape_seth_inventory_full )
    COP [PrintDialogString] ( &CapeGlassesReceived )
    RTL
  cape_seth_inventory_full:
    JML $@f_inventory_full.InventoryFullMessage
}

CapeSethGlassesOffer `[BOR:3][PRT:@CapeUpper4][PRT:@CapeSeth]Seth: Ha, I just won these[N]cool sun glasses from[N]Lance, but I already wear[N]glasses,[WAI][N]so I can't use them.[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][PRT:@CapeUpper4][PRT:@CapeSeth]Here Will, I owe you for[N]helping me find my shark[N]tooth necklace, so you[N]take it.[END]`
CapeGlassesReceived `[DEF]Received the Black[N]Crystal Glasses![END]`

sc02_seth.dialogstring_04B612! `[BOR:3][PRT:@CapeUpper4][PRT:@CapeSeth]Seth: Girls are lame.[N]Adventure stories in[N]books are more fun.[END]`
sc02_seth.dialogstring_04B72B! `[BOR:3][PRT:@CapeUpper4][PRT:@CapeSeth]Seth: Come on![N]What R you waiting for?[END]`
sc02_seth.dialogstring_04B77C! `[BOR:3][PRT:@CapeUpper4][PRT:@CapeSeth]Seth: No matter how many[N]times I see it, it's still[N]amazing.[WAI][N]Characteristically, Will[N]can move only that statue.[N]But why can't you move[N]anything else[AD]?[END]`
sc02_seth.dialogstring_04B7DE! `[BOR:3][PRT:@CapeUpper4][PRT:@CapeSeth]Seth: Characteristically,[N]people rely on five[N]senses: sight, hearing,[N]taste, smell, and touch.[WAI][N]But Will seems to have a[N]sixth sense. The way he[N]interacts with the world[N]is different.[WAI][N]Moving things, knowing[N]which card to pick, and[N]dreams that come true[AD][FIN][CLD][BOR:3][PRT:@CapeUpper4][PRT:@CapeSeth]Whatever happened last[N]year[AD] it changed Will.[END]`
sc02_seth.dialogstring_04B5B6! `[BOR:3][PRT:@CapeUpper4][PRT:@CapeSeth]Seth: Ahaha! I'm sure to[N]win again.[END]`
sc02_seth.dialogstring_04B652! `[BOR:3][PRT:@CapeUpper4][PRT:@CapeSeth]Seth: Alright, since[N]everyone's here, what's[N]the plan for today?[FIN][CLD][PAU:1E][BOR:3][PRT:@CapeUpper4][PRT:@CapeErik]Erik: Hey, I wanna see[N]Will's mysterious power.[WAI][N]Come on, didn't you show[N]us the other day? You can[N]move things without using[N]your hands.[END]`
sc02_seth.dialogstring_04B75D! `[BOR:3][PRT:@CapeUpper1][PRT:@CapeLance]Lance: Aah! It moooooved![PAU:28][END]`

?INCLUDE 'sc03_lances_mother'
sc03_lances_mother.dialogstring_048F19! `[CLD][BOR:3][PRT:@CapeLower4][PRT:@CapeResident]Lance's Mother: It's been[N]a whole year, hasn't it?[WAI][N]Your father and my husband[N]both went missing at[N]the Tower of Babel.[WAI][N]Somehow, it still feels[N]like it was yesterday[AD][END]`

?INCLUDE 'sc04_eriks_father'
sc04_eriks_father.dialogstring_048FEF! `[BOR:3][PRT:@CapeLower4][PRT:@CapeResident]Erik's Father: Everyone[N]acts jealous of this big[N]house[AD][WAI][N]But it's not a big deal.[N]We simply moved to this[N]town a little earlier than[N]everyone else.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'sc04_eriks_mother'
sc04_eriks_mother.dialogstring_04907B! `[CLD][BOR:3][PRT:@CapeLower4][PRT:@CapeResident]Erik's Mother: No, my back[N]isn't on fire. Hahaha.[N]This is an eastern therapy[N]called moxibustion.[WAI][N]With a big house, even[N]just cleaning is bound[N]to cause shoulder pain[AD][END]`

?INCLUDE 'sc04_poverty'
sc04_poverty.dialogstring_048F9D! `[BOR:3][PRT:@CapeLower4][PRT:@CapeResident]Who me? I'm just the[N]housekeeper.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'sc05_seths_father'
sc05_seths_father.dialogstring_049193! `[BOR:3][PRT:@CapeUpper4][PRT:@CapeResident]Seth's Father: Hmph.[WAI][N]I bust my hump for that[N]money, so what's wrong[N]with spending some of it[N]on a little booze?![END]`

?INCLUDE 'sc05_seths_mother'
sc05_seths_mother.dialogstring_049110! `[CLD][BOR:3][PRT:@CapeUpper4][PRT:@CapeResident]Seth's Mother: It's no[N]joke! That man![WAI][N]I put up with it for[N]Seth's sake, but if it[N]weren't for him, I'd have[N]left a long time ago![FIN][CLD][BOR:3][PRT:@CapeLower4][PRT:@CapeThought](What's no joke is that[N]pot. It almost hit me.)[END]`

?INCLUDE 'sc06_bill'
sc06_bill.dialogstring_04941D! `[CLD][BOR:3][PRT:@CapeUpper4][PRT:@CapeLance]Bill: Ohh, welcome home.[N]Getting back at this hour[N]must mean you were kept[N]behind again, huh?[WAI][N]Bwahaha.[N]Splendid, splendid.[WAI][N]Even if a boy can't study,[N]being lively and spirited[N]is better, I always say.[END]`
sc06_bill.dialogstring_04956D! `[BOR:3][PRT:@CapeUpper4][PRT:@CapeLance]Bill: That sounds like her[N]screaming right now![END]`
sc06_bill.dialogstring_0495C9! `[PAU:F][BOR:3][PRT:@CapeUpper4][PRT:@CapeLance]Bill: Long ago, I used to[N]be an architect.[END]`
sc06_bill.dialogstring_049828! `[BOR:3][PRT:@CapeUpper4][PRT:@CapeLance]Bill: Good morning. I had[N]to eat more of Grandma[N]Lola's pie for breakfast[AD][N][PAU:12]*heavy sigh*[END]`
sc06_bill.dialogstring_04977F! `[BOR:3][PRT:@CapeUpper4][PRT:@CapeLance]Bill: A crystal ring? Hm[AD][N]I don't think I've even[N]heard of such a thing.[WAI][N]There wasn't anything like[N]that in the baggage left[N]behind by your father[AD][WAI][N]At any rate, why not go to[N]Edward Castle?[WAI][N]Perhaps you'll be able to[N]meet the princess from[N]yesterday again, as well.[N]Bwahahaha.[END]`
sc06_bill.dialogstring_0494B1! `[CLD][BOR:3][PRT:@CapeUpper4][PRT:@CapeLance]Bill: Good gracious. I[N]haven't sung like that in[N]a long time.[WAI][N]Your Grandma Lola used[N]to be a singer at a bar.[WAI][N]I fell in love with her[N]voice[AD][WAI][N]And her heart too, of[N]course. Bwahaha.[END]`
sc06_bill.dialogstring_04953E! `[CLD][BOR:2][PRT:@CapeUpper1][PRT:@CapeKara][DLY:0]No-o-o-o-o!!![FIN][CLD][DEF]A shriek rings out from[N]the first floor![END]`
sc06_bill.dialogstring_04958A! `[CLD][BOR:3][PRT:@CapeUpper4][PRT:@CapeLance]Bill: Well, I can't say I[N]believed much of that[N]girl's story.[WAI][N]It sounded pretty flimsy[N]to me.[WAI][N]Still, she had a wonderful[N]singing voice[AD][WAI][N]and she certainly seemed[N]interested in meeting you.[WAI][N]You may not think much of[N]girls in pretty dresses[N]yet, Will[AD][WAI][N]but trust your grandpa.[N]You will soon enough![N]Bwahahaha.[END]`
sc06_bill.dialogstring_0495EB! `[CLD][BOR:3][PRT:@CapeUpper4][PRT:@CapeLance]Bill: There's a prison[N]beneath the castle.[WAI][N]I designed it as a maze[N]so prisoners couldn't[N]escape easily.[WAI][N]These days I can't help[N]thinking about everyone[N]still being locked inside[N]something I built[AD][END]`
sc06_bill.dialogstring_049685! `[CLD][BOR:3][PRT:@CapeUpper4][PRT:@CapeLance]Bill: Hey, Will. Doesn't[N]Grandma Lola's cooking[N]seem a little odd[N]lately?[WAI][N]Last night, licorice and[N]rice. Before that, mouse[N]fritters. I can barely[N]keep up.[WAI][N]I can't tell if her mind[N]is starting to go with[N]age, or if she's stressed[N]about something[AD][WAI][N][AD]something she isn't[N]sharing. I'm not sure[N]which I fear more.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'sc06_hamlet'
sc06_hamlet.dialogstring_04A311! `[CLD][BOR:3][PRT:@CapeUpper4][PRT:@CapeThought](I know Aunt Lola's been[N]trying new recipes, but[N]I don't think pork is[N]supposed to be this raw.)[END]`
sc06_hamlet.dialogstring_04A356! `[BOR:2][PRT:@CapeUpper1](oink oink)[END]`

?INCLUDE 'sc06_kara'
sc06_kara.dialogstring_04A0D7! `[BOR:3][PRT:@CapeUpper4][PRT:@CapeLilly]Kara: I think you have[N]the wrong girl. You see,[N]I'm a flower girl called[N]Popongo.[FIN][CLD][PAU:F][BOR:7][PRT:@CapeUpper4][PRT:@CapeGuard]Soldier: Your Highness![N]Do you think I can be[N]fooled with such a[AD][FIN][CLD][BOR:2][DLG:3,6][SIZ:A,1][PRT:@CapeGuard][AD]red-faced lie[AD]?![FIN][BOR:7][PRT:@CapeUpper4][PRT:@CapeGuard]This is a direct order[N]from the king. Even if we[N]have to use brute force,[N]we're taking you home![END]`
sc06_kara.dialogstring_049FBC! `[BOR:7][PRT:@CapeUpper4][PRT:@CapeKara]Kara: I know. It was the[N]Olman expedition party,[N]and there was an accident,[N]right?[FIN][CLD][PAU:F][BOR:3][PRT:@CapeUpper4][PRT:@CapeWill]Will: He's definitely[N]coming home someday.[FIN][CLD][PAU:F][BOR:7][PRT:@CapeUpper4][PRT:@CapeKara]Kara: Are you angry[AD]?[N]No, that's not it.[WAI][N]I've made you sad,[N]haven't I? How stupid[N]of me[AD] [PAU:18]I'm sorry[AD][END]`
sc06_kara.dialogstring_04A04C! `[BOR:7][PRT:@CapeUpper4][PRT:@CapeKara]Kara: Anyway, is there[N]not a piano in this house?[FIN][CLD][PAU:F][BOR:3][PRT:@CapeUpper4][PRT:@CapeWill]Will: No, I'm afraid not.[N]My Grandma Lola is an[N]incredible singer, though.[FIN][CLD][PAU:F][BOR:7][PRT:@CapeUpper4][PRT:@CapeKara]Kara: Speaking of[N]singing, both of your[N]grandparents are upstairs,[N]doing just that.[WAI][N]They have such loud[N]voices![END]`
sc06_kara.dialogstring_04A15A! `[BOR:7][PRT:@CapeUpper4][PRT:@CapeKara]Kara: I'm sorry for[N]lying to you. I'm really[N]Kara, the princess of[N]Edward Castle.[WAI][N]You said your name is[N]Will? It doesn't feel like[N]the first time we've met.[WAI][N]It somehow seems like[N]we'll be good friends.[END]`
sc06_kara.dialogstring_04A0D2! `[BOR:7][PRT:@CapeUpper4][PRT:@CapeKara]Kara: Sometimes blending[N]voices is more important[N]than just belting out[N]every note.[END]`
sc06_kara.dialogstring_049EB4! `[CLD][BOR:7][PRT:@CapeUpper4][PRT:@CapeKara]Kara: Oh my, Hamlet. You[N]shouldn't snort at[N]strangers![WAI][N]Is this your house?[FIN][CLD][PAU:F][BOR:3][PRT:@CapeUpper4][PRT:@CapeWill]Will: Yeah. Is this your[N]pig?[END]`
sc06_kara.dialogstring_049F09! `[CLD][BOR:7][PRT:@CapeUpper4][PRT:@CapeKara]Kara: Your clothes are a[N]bit drab, aren't they?[FIN][CLD][PAU:F][BOR:3][PRT:@CapeUpper4][PRT:@CapeWill]Will: Well, excuse me![FIN][CLD][PAU:F][BOR:7][PRT:@CapeUpper4][PRT:@CapeKara]Kara: Oh, don't be so[N]touchy. I was only being[N]honest.[END]`
sc06_kara.dialogstring_049F71! `[CLD][BOR:7][PRT:@CapeLower4][PRT:@CapeKara]Kara: Are those your[N]parents in this picture?[FIN][CLD][PAU:F][BOR:3][PRT:@CapeLower4][PRT:@CapeWill]Will: Yeah. My dad went[N]on an expedition, and[AD][END]`

?INCLUDE 'sc06_lola'
sc06_lola.dialogstring_0499F1! `[BOR:3][PRT:@CapeUpper4][PRT:@CapeErik]Lola: Oh, Will! Welcome[N]home. Dinner's not quite[N]ready, so you still have[N]time to go play outside.[END]`
sc06_lola.dialogstring_049ABB! `[BOR:3][PRT:@CapeUpper4][PRT:@CapeErik]Lola: Welcome home, Will.[N]Silly me. I lose track of[N]time when singing opera.[WAI][N]Dinner isn't ready yet.[END]`
sc06_lola.dialogstring_049A3F! `[BOR:3][PRT:@CapeUpper4][PRT:@CapeErik]Lola: Ohohohoo! Stop it,[N]dear! Bringing up a thing[N]like that right now[AD][WAI][N][PAU:F]Oh yes! Will, try not to[N]be too surprised.[WAI][N]Until just a moment ago,[N]there was a girl here[N]singing with us, you know[AD][END]`
sc06_lola.dialogstring_049B82! `[PAU:40][BOR:3][PRT:@CapeUpper4][PRT:@CapeErik]Lola: Okay, that's enough[N]depressing talk. Dinner's[N]about ready. Let's eat.[WAI][N]I baked a delicious pie.[N]Please come along now,[N]both of you. We'll sit[N]at the table upstairs.[END]`
sc06_lola.dialogstring_049D29! `[BOR:3][PRT:@CapeUpper4][PRT:@CapeThought][SFX:7][DLY:5](What a wonderful[N]melody[AD])[FIN][CLD][PAU:58][DEF][SFX:0]Even though Will had never[N]heard it before, for some[N]reason, it filled him with[N]a deep longing.[FIN][CLD][PAU:60][PRT:@CapeUpper1][SFX:0]Learned Lola's Melody![PAU:40][END]`
sc06_lola.dialogstring_049D94! `[BOR:3][PRT:@CapeUpper4][PRT:@CapeErik]Lola: Go, and be careful.[END]`
sc06_lola.code_0499D3! {
    COP [PrintDialogString] ( &CapeLolaDinnerRepeat )
    RTL
}
CapeLolaDinnerRepeat `[BOR:3][PRT:@CapeUpper4][PRT:@CapeErik]Lola: I'm trying something[N]a little different for[N]dinner tonight. I hope[N]you enjoy it, Will.[END]`
sc06_lola.dialogstring_049B18! `[BOR:3][PRT:@CapeUpper4][PRT:@CapeErik]Lola: What an eventful[N]evening![FIN][CLD][BOR:3][PRT:@CapeUpper4][PRT:@CapeLance]Bill: And if she's[N]a princess from Edward[N]Castle, her family must be[N]loaded.[WAI][N]Let's see[AD] pretty, sings[N]beautifully, rich family[AD][N][PAU:1E]Hmm. Will, you could do[N]a lot worse![FIN][CLD][BOR:3][PRT:@CapeUpper4][PRT:@CapeErik]Lola: Oh, honestly,[N]dear! Leave the poor boy[N]alone.[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][PRT:@CapeUpper4][PRT:@CapeLance]Bill: Bwahahaha! I'm only[N]thinking ahead![FIN][CLD][BOR:3][PRT:@CapeUpper4][PRT:@CapeErik]Lola: Before your[N]grandfather starts[N]planning [PAU:12]the wedding[AD][WAI][N]speaking of Edward Castle,[N]there's something you may[N]not know.[WAI][N]A vast aqueduct lies[N]beneath the castle.[WAI][N]And the person who[N]designed that labyrinth[N]was your grandfather.[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][PRT:@CapeUpper4][PRT:@CapeWill]Will: Huh? Really?[END]`
sc06_lola.dialogstring_049BE5! `[BOR:3][PRT:@CapeUpper4][PRT:@CapeErik]Lola: Good morning, Will.[N]A letter from King Edward[N]came for you.[WAI][N]This is what it says[AD][FIN][CLD][PAU:F][PRT:@CapeLetter][PRT:@CapeLance][SFX:0]"Please bring the Crystal[N] Ring found among Olman's[N] belongings to Edward[N] Castle."[N][N]             -King Edward[FIN][CLD][PAU:F][BOR:3][PRT:@CapeUpper4][PRT:@CapeErik]Lola: Ever since I saw[N]this letter, I've had a[N]bad feeling.[WAI][N]Ah, that's it! Will, let[N]me teach you this melody.[N]Think of it as a charm[N]for good luck.[WAI][N]If you ever find yourself[N]in trouble, play it. I'm[N]sure it will help.[FIN][CLD][PAU:F][DEF]Lola hummed a mysterious[N]melody.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'sc06_main_soldier'
sc06_main_soldier.dialogstring_04A3BB! `[CLD][BOR:7][PRT:@CapeUpper4][PRT:@CapeGuard]Soldier: Your Highness.[N]We've been looking for[N]you![FIN][CLD][PAU:F][BOR:2][DLG:3,6][SIZ:C,2][PRT:@CapeKara]Kara: I don't know any[N]of you. Get out![FIN][CLD][PAU:F][BOR:7][PRT:@CapeUpper4][PRT:@CapeGuard]Soldier: What are you[N]saying? If I don't bring[N]you home, my head will[N]roll![END]`

?INCLUDE 'sc06_monologue'
sc06_monologue.dialogstring_04A4CC! `[DEF]In the end, dinner was a[N]snail pie that was[N]absolutely loaded with[N]whipped cream[AD][FIN][CLD][DEF]Will could only stomach a[N]small piece, but Grandpa[N]Bill powered through and[N]ate three slices.[FIN][CLD][DEF]That night, Will dreamt[N]that he and Kara[N]were traveling around the[N]world together[AD][END]`
sc06_monologue.dialogstring_04A582! `[CLD][BOR:3][PRT:@CapeLower4][PRT:@CapeThought](But I never told her[N]my name[AD])[END]`

?INCLUDE 'sc07_chef'
sc07_chef.dialogstring_0491ED! `[CLD][BOR:3][PRT:@CapeUpper4][PRT:@CapeResident]Mmm, nice smell.[N]There's no stove, so[N]I'm cooking in this pot.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'sc08_erik'
sc08_erik.dialogstring_048DD1! `[CLD][BOR:3][PRT:@CapeUpper4][PRT:@CapeSeth]Seth: Alright! Same place[N]as usual![END]`
sc08_erik.dialogstring_048E00! `[BOR:3][PRT:@CapeUpper4][PRT:@CapeErik]Erik: I'll be there, but I[N]need to hurry home first[AD][WAI][N]If I don't, mama will find[N]out that I had to stay for[N]make-up lessons again.[N]Heheh[AD][END]`

?INCLUDE 'sc08_lance'
sc08_lance.dialogstring_048D3A! `[CLD][BOR:3][PRT:@CapeUpper4][PRT:@CapeLance]Lance: Alright! Same as[N]always, we'll meet at the[N]cave by the seashore![END]`

?INCLUDE 'sc08_priest'
sc08_priest.dialogstring_048AE9! `[CLD][DEF][DLY:0]A year has passed since[N]Will joined his father[N]on an expedition to the[N]Tower of Babel.[FIN][DEF]The expedition ended in[N]disaster.[FIN][DEF]Only Will returned to[N]South Cape, with no memory[N]of how he survived.[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][PRT:@CapeUpper4][PRT:@CapeThought](Everyone says I was[N]lucky[AD][N]But Dad isn't gone. I[N]won't believe that.[WAI][N]Someday I'll become an[N]explorer and travel the[N]world.[WAI][N]Somewhere out there, I'll[N]find him.)[END]`
sc08_priest.dialogstring_048C98! `[CLD][BOR:3][PRT:@CapeLower4][PRT:@CapeResident]Priest: Come now, Will.[N]Please pray with me.[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][PRT:@CapeLower4][PRT:@CapeResident]May the world[N]continue to shine on for[N]all eternity[AD][END]`
sc08_priest.dialogstring_048C01! `[BOR:3][PRT:@CapeLower4][PRT:@CapeResident]Priest: Let's go ahead and[N]end today's lesson here.[WAI][N]Going forward, I'd like[N]the four of you to do your[N]best not to fall behind.[WAI][N]Furthermore, demons have[N]been sighted outside of[N]town. If you must go far,[N]please bring a parent.[END]`
sc08_priest.dialogstring_048CDB! `[CLD][BOR:3][PRT:@CapeLower3][PRT:@CapeResident]Will[AD] you seem troubled.[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][PRT:@CapeLower4][PRT:@CapeResident]I won't ask you to explain[N]what happened.[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][PRT:@CapeLower4][PRT:@CapeResident]But whatever lies ahead,[N]don't forget that South[N]Cape is your home.[END]`

; The bell uses hidden-jewel spawn type $03: ($03 >> 1) + $80.
sc01_roof_man.code_0484B2! {
    LDA #$0081
    JSL $@flag_helpers.TestEventFlag_0200
    BCC cape_bell_hint
    COP [PrintDialogString] ( &CapeBellThanks )
    RTL
  cape_bell_hint:
    COP [PrintDialogString] ( &sc01_roof_man.dialogstring_0484B7 )
    RTL
}
CapeBellThanks `[CLD][BOR:3][PRT:@CapeLower4][PRT:@CapeResident]Thanks for the help,[N]Will.[WAI][N]You've got this habit of[N]jumping down from all[N]sorts of places[AD] *sigh*[WAI][N]I can't help worrying[N]about you.[END]`

; Gaia's first meeting, journal prompt, and farewell share the Dark Space actor.
?INCLUDE 'sE6_gaia'
sE6_gaia.dialogstring_08DD0B! `[BOR:4][PRT:@CapeLower4][PRT:@CapeGaiaTheme]I am Gaia, fountainhead of[N]life. Henceforth, I shall[N]offer aid in thy journey.[WAI][N]Only those in whom the[N]Power of Darkness dwells[N]can see this space.[N]Thou art one such human.[WAI][N]Here in the Dark Space,[N]thy strength is restored.[WAI][N]Thy journey may be[N]recorded. Pray return[N]often.[FIN]`
sE6_gaia.dialogstring_08DDCB! `[CLD][BOR:4][PRT:@CapeLower4][PRT:@CapeGaiaTheme]What sayest thou? Record[N]thy adventure thus far?[N][PAL:0] Record[N] Don't record`
sE6_gaia.dialogstring_08DE43! `[CLD][PAU:27][BOR:4][PRT:@CapeLower4][PRT:@CapeGaiaTheme]Go forth now upon thy[N]journey.[END]`

